        "text": "Page: Patrick Carpentier. Sentence: Patrick Carpentier (born August 13, 1971) is a Canadian professional auto racing driver.\nPage: Patrick Carpentier. Sentence: He currently competes part-time in the NASCAR Sprint Cup Series, driving the No. 32 Ford Fusion for Go FAS Racing.\nPage: Ford Fusion (Americas). Sentence: Introduced for model year 2006, the Fusion is manufactured at Ford's Hermosillo Stamping & Assembly plant along with its rebadged variant the Lincoln MKZ — and formerly with its now discontinued rebadged variant, the Mercury Milan, all sharing the CD3 platform.\nPage: 1997 CART season. Sentence: Rookie of the Year was Patrick Carpentier.\nPage: 1997 Marlboro 500. Sentence: The 1997 Marlboro 500 was the 17th and last round of the 1997 CART season.",
